# CODEOWNERS — review-ownership partition for apothem.
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Every pull request that touches a matched path automatically requests
# review from the listed owner. apothem is currently a single-maintainer
# project; @ahmed-g-gad owns every path. As co-maintainers are added (see
# MAINTAINERS.md + GOVERNANCE.md Maintainer Lifecycle), per-subtree
# ownership rows below the global rule narrow the partition.
#
# Syntax: <path-pattern> <owner> [<owner> ...]
# Later matches take precedence over earlier ones.

# Global ownership — every file.
*                       @ahmed-g-gad

# Source tree.
/src/apothem/           @ahmed-g-gad

# Per-harness adapters.
/src/apothem/harnesses/ @ahmed-g-gad

# CI / release / supply-chain surfaces.
/.github/               @ahmed-g-gad

# Project-governance + visibility surfaces.
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @ahmed-g-gad
/GOVERNANCE.md          @ahmed-g-gad
/MAINTAINERS.md         @ahmed-g-gad
/SECURITY.md            @ahmed-g-gad
/pyproject.toml         @ahmed-g-gad
